  "description": "AERA FOR EVERYONE. The MACINA AERA combines sporty e-MTB DNA with full everyday practicality. LFC stands for LIGHT-FENDER-CARRIER, equipping the models with lights, fenders and a luggage rack to create versatile companions for daily commutes, extended tours and spontaneous detours beyond paved roads. At the top of the range is the new MACINA AERA 891 LFC. A key feature of the AERA platform is its consistent Size-Split concept (excluding PTS frames). Frame sizes 43, 46 and 51 cm roll on 27.5-inch wheels, providing agile and well-balanced handling. Sizes 56 and 60 cm feature 29-inch wheels, offering increased stability and confident rollover performance. This ensures that geometry and wheel size are optimally matched to each frame size. Powerful support is provided by the Bosch Performance Line CX (BDU384Y), delivering up to 100 Nm of torque, 750 watts of maximum motor power and up to 600% support. Combined with the 800 Wh PowerTube, it provides the power and range needed for both everyday riding and extended tours. When it comes to battery integration, KTM continues to rely on its proven POWER TUBE TOP LOADER (PTTL) system. The battery can be co nveniently removed upwards from the downtube and just as easily reinserted.",
